{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37988","headline":"访同年虞部李郎中 · 韩偓","name":"访同年虞部李郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"策蹇相寻犯雪泥，厨烟未动日平西。\n门庭野水䙰褷鹭，邻里短墙咿喔鸡。\n未入庆霄君择肉，畏逢华毂我吹韲。\n地炉贳酒成狂醉，更觉襟怀得丧齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}